.SH INTERACTIVE CONTROLS: MBview Projections Window
The toggles take effect immediately.
.TP
.B [Projections]:{Display Projection}<<Geographic><UTM><Spheroid>>
These select the projection of the display: geographic coordinates, the UTM
zone of the grid center, or a spheroidal (globe) view, which is always
